{"4264210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orbital Fighter", "steam_appid": 4264210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge! Deflect! Unleash!</strong><br>Take control of a fighter ship in this space-themed flight action game.<br>Master the game’s signature mechanics—<strong>Just Dodge</strong> and <strong>Just Parry</strong>—to suppress the planetary fortress that serves as the rebel army’s stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemy attacks at the very last moment to <strong>store energy</strong>, then <strong>release it all at once with a powerful parry</strong>!<br>Experience the thrill of narrowly avoiding relentless enemy fire and the exhilarating rush of perfectly timed parries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Controllers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox Controller</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVE</strong>: Left Stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REFLECT (Parry)</strong>: RB Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DODGE</strong>: LB Button</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge! Deflect! Unleash!</strong><br>Take control of a fighter ship in this space-themed flight action game.<br>Master the game’s signature mechanics—<strong>Just Dodge</strong> and <strong>Just Parry</strong>—to suppress the planetary fortress that serves as the rebel army’s stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemy attacks at the very last moment to <strong>store energy</strong>, then <strong>release it all at once with a powerful parry</strong>!<br>Experience the thrill of narrowly avoiding relentless enemy fire and the exhilarating rush of perfectly timed parries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Controllers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox Controller</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_t